PRIMARY CLOSED-WORLD NEGATIVE
A hypothesis ecology can still fail catastrophically
if it assumes:

ONE OF MY CURRENT MODELS
MUST BE TRUE.

MODEL-FIT / NONE-OF-THE-ABOVE GATE
A rolling specialized-action calibration error
tracks:
whether
ANY retained hypothesis
fits recent evidence.

Persistent poor fit:
enters:
UNKNOWN state.

UNKNOWN expression:

use:
the generic safe fallback

and
periodically test:
specialized hypotheses.

Primary diagnostic point:

specialized reality check:
approximately every 20 steps.

