reality checks.

H97:
disagreement should be:
value-gated
and
combined with:
model-fit / none-of-the-above state.

DISAGREEMENT
asks:

WHICH RETAINED THEORY IS RIGHT?

MODEL-FIT
asks:

IS ANY RETAINED THEORY
GOOD ENOUGH?

Those are different questions.

