GENERAL PRINCIPLE
INTERNAL SCIENCE SHOULD HAVE:

THEORY PLURALISM

+

DORMANT MEMORY

+

MODEL-FIT UNCERTAINTY

+

VALUE-GATED EXPERIMENTS

+

NONE-OF-THE-ABOVE.

Do not let:

SURPRISE
->
PROBE EVERYTHING.

Do not let:

LOW CURRENT PROBABILITY
->
DELETE THEORY.

And do not let:

MODEL SET
->
CLOSED WORLD.

DECISION
AR-H97 is POSITIVE WITH AN OUT-OF-MODEL REACTIVATION TRADEOFF.

Supported synthetically:

- retained hypothesis ecologies adapt to recurring causal regimes;
- naive surprise-driven probing is prohibitively wasteful;
- persistent suspicion + information-gain gating uses very few experiments;
- value-gated challenge modestly improves transition adaptation;
- hard model pruning harms recurring-regime recovery;
- an explicit none-of-the-above state protects against severe model misspecification;
- safe unknown fallback has a real cost when a known regime later returns;
- reactivation auditing is another value-of-information problem.

Not demonstrated:

- autonomous hypothesis creation;
- learned causal graph structure;
- model mutation / reproduction;
- distributed hypothesis ecology across cells;
- real experimental interventions;
- optimal unknown-state exit.

NEXT HIGH-VALUE MOVE
AR-H98 — RESIDUAL-DRIVEN HYPOTHESIS BIRTH / OPEN-WORLD MODEL ECOLOGY

H97 can recognize:

NONE OF MY MODELS FIT.

But it cannot yet:
MAKE A NEW MODEL.

Question:

Can persistent structured residual error
seed:
a new local hypothesis

without:
a central architecture search?

Candidate sequence:

KNOWN MODEL SET
->
MODEL-FIT FAILURE
->
SAFE UNKNOWN STATE
->
BOUNDED DIAGNOSTIC SAMPLING
->
RESIDUAL CLUSTER
->
NEW HYPOTHESIS SEED
->
SHADOW VALIDATION
->
PROVISIONAL LIVE AUTHORITY.

Required negatives:

- pure noise should not create model proliferation;
- one transient regime should not earn permanent model memory;
- new hypothesis should not overwrite old dormant models;
- repeated novel regime should reactivate:
the newly learned model.

Desired:

HYPOTHESIS ECOLOGY
becomes:
OPEN-WORLD.

The organism can:
retain old theories

and
grow new ones

when:
reality stays outside:
the current model family.

Do not execute STAB-18-R1 during this lane.

